window.JOURNAL = {
"2022": [],
"2023": ["The Crack in the Sidewalk got published in Door is a Jar and Tim and I went over to find it on the shelves of Barnes and Noble in Atlanta. We were there to catch a few games of the Braves to celebrate Tim's birthday.","We got married!! My favorite late May, early June ever.","A summer of creative programming, I did my 30 days of Creative Programming in July and created the Internet Payphone, the Joiner camera (in tribute by David Hockney), the Hovertone, and more.","Tons of writing this year and launched jakeweber.net."],
"2024": ["I joined Clutch seeking a major change after feeling stagnant at Q2. One month in I flew down to Rio, my first time not only in Brazil but in South America. Notified about not being selected for the OSV grant after reaching the final stage, the trip where I lost 100k!","Our trip to Mexico City! Our first time there to celebrate one year of marriage. Magical. I remember the mango outside of Frida's house and evening walks under the trees. And the food, and the Tokyo Record Bar and the gorgeous Uma Casa with breakfast on the roof.","A lot of creative work. Was really in a zone! Greenwich and lots of blog posts, Printernet in full swing.","The first time back to HHI in a long while (10 years!). It was phenomenal. Flew into Atlanta and spent a day or so at GG's. Kate, Eleanor, and Will were with us too. Then we all drove up to HH and met Mom, Paulie, Tim, Brooklynn and Zeke."],
"2025": ["Chatted with Sam for his podcast 'Inventory-ing' and shared some cool projects to start the year off.","Working on the novel, working working and dreaming of that long gone suburb.","Back at Hilton Head in late July. Long walks down to the end of the beach to gather sea shells and bring them back to occupy a lucky window sill.","Scanned hundreds of books and media searching for the perfect letters for Printernet's collab with Sublime for Whoa volume 2.","A wonderful Thanksgiving with Luke, Rod and Abby.","Read 'The Writing Life' by Annie Dillard and was entranced.","A magical Christmas with Mom, Paulie, and the whole Austin crew. The first annual \"Scrooge\" contest and then off to see Marty Supreme on Christmas day.","Saved June pup's life together, a rough end of the year and 30th for Tessa but we did it <3"],
"2026": ["Early travel, big trip to Rio for Clutch and Tessa and Jen came down too. We took a gorgeous trip out to a private house in Ilha Grande. It felt like being in a bowl, with mountains surrounding the wide stretching water.","Then to Paris a week or two after returning from Rio. Out to the country for Kate's wedding then back for a week in Paris. Remember wine nights with Luke and Rod, meeting Kate and Remi for dinner, and biking all over with the crew. And don't forget the sandwiches from Deserie, the coffee from Tanat, and the bread from mamiche. Then to Switzerland with a pit stop in Lyon. One of the best lunches of our lives. And then my god! The bells on the cows like windchimes all the time, the mountain drives (swapping out the EV that couldn't swing it), and those little villages by way of the steepest cable car I'd ever take.","Summer back in Austin. Starting a garden to try and capture some of the magic of travel back at home. Then comes 'Weeds' in my brand new notebook Tessa gifted me for my 30th. Evening walks at Abby's with the whole crew. Reading 'Weeds' at Alienated Majesty with the Austin chapter of the Author's Guild. Hosted HTML Day 2026 at Terrible Love and met some great folks."],
};
